# body

Intended path docs/x.md -> md mode. The legit reviewed-allow path: a
`publisher: CalGEM` source-citation field WITH an exact-matching inline-array
marker `[publisher: CalGEM]`. parse_allow_pairs emits (publisher, CalGEM); the
gate's exact-pair compare skips the block for THAT pair only -> ALLOW. The author
field is the PRINCIPAL, so nothing else blocks.
